{"id":"antes","lemma":"antes","pos":"adv","rank":102,"glosses":["earlier; before; sooner; previously; formerly; beforehand (at an earlier time)","soon (in certain phrases)","ahead (temporally), ahead of (when followed by de)"],"ipa":"/ˈantes/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/44/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-antes.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo estaba aquí antes.","en":"I was here first.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/95842"},{"text":"La he visto antes.","en":"I saw her earlier.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/100974"},{"text":"Ya nos conocimos antes.","en":"We've already met.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800477"},{"text":"¿Nos hemos encontrado antes?","en":"Have we met before?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450061"},{"text":"Agitar antes de usar.","en":"Shake before using.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636418"}]}